[Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  at android studio we have built  expertise on strategy games with titles  such as endless space  endless legend and more recently  humankind  when we released it in 2014 dungeon of  the endless was our first  venture into the roguelike juan a unique  mix of strategy  action and rpg mechanics never seen  before  [Music]  in dungeon of the endless the player has  to protect the generator  of his crashed ship while exploring an  almost infinite dungeon  all while facing waves of monsters as he  tries to find his way out  [Music]  the game ended up winning a lot of  awards for its game design  and shall we say captured the hearts of  both amplitude fans  and roguelike fans but even knowing this  we didn't really expect such an  enthusiastic reaction when we revealed  the next game  endless dungeon at the game awards in  december 2020  endless dungeon is the return of  amplitude on the roguelike scene a genre  we like a lot  the game is a spiritual sequel of the  original dungeon of the endless keeping  the core pillars of the game  all while proposing a whole new  experience for fans and new players  alike  now because of the first game's success  we knew the formula was loved by players  but we were still seeing a lot of  potential and new ideas to explore  i remember exactly how the product  started  we're all together having like a big  party at amplitude to celebrate  something i have no idea what it was and  we had a lot of beer  and someone came with the idea of you  know and  and what if we made our own  so for the first time we had the product  validated uh it may be like five days  you know um  after like  you know and and that's that's an  amazing moment that's yeah pretty much  how it  started now the player will still have  to escort the crystal using the hero  skills plus  weapons turrets and a good dose of good  thinking  to be able to make it all the way to the  exit the heroes will also be more  important than ever in endless dungeon  as you'll be able to unlock and recruit  a bunch of colorful characters  each one with their specificity special  attacks their biography and backgrounds  and the way they react to events in the  dungeon we've already discovered four of  them in the previous trailers now but i  know everyone's asking  will the pug be there well we know she'd  love to be there  we'll have to see what happens  [Music]  we also believe that no one should go on  a seemingly hopeless mission alone so  endless dungeon is meant to be playable  either solo or with your friends in  co-op we hope to deliver a great co-op  experience so you can explore the  dungeon with your friends  we would also like to step up the  community engagement a notch  frequently proposing votes on our games  together platform  this will allow players to directly  impact the game by voting on various  topics such as lore gameplay  and concepts and as always giving  feedback to the dev team  player feedback has always been crucial  to the way we make games so keep an eye  out for opportunities to try the game  and let us know what you think  the community already chose that  official name and the creeper's name  so now we have so much more coming for  you on games together so you can  participate to the production of endless  dungeon  so sign up to games together to stay in  the loop cast your votes and make your  voice heard

